        },
        {
          "text": "Aburamu amaze imyaka mirongwicenda n’icenda, Uhoraho aramubonekera, aramubarira, ati Ni jewe Mana Ishobora vyose; uhore ugendera imbere yanje, kand’ utungane rwose. ",
