            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Aburahamu arapfukama, arūnama aratwenga, yivuganiriza mu mutima, ati Mbeg’ umwana yovyarwa n’ūmaze imyaka ijana? Na Sara amaze imyaka mirongwicenda yoba akivyara? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburahamu abgira Imana, at’ Icompa Ishimayeli agakomera, akaba imbere y’inyonga zawe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
